<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT-Entel upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Entel upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said it was upgrading Chile's Empresa Nacional de Telecomunicaciones SA (Entel) to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- No details were available on the upgrade for Entel, Chile's main long-distance operator.</p>
<p>-- Entel was up one peso to 3,000.</p>
<p>((-- Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
